		"description": "<p>Your psionic capabilities and wilderness skills have combined to make you into a fearsome apex predator. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Wisdom score or your Intelligence score increases by +1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>While your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.rKYtSucPFAtDqTpj]{Psychic Focus} is active, you may spend an exertion point to teleport up to 50 feet instead of moving as normal.</p></li><li><p>Creatures that take psychic damage from your weapon attacks must make a Constitution saving throw against your maneuver DC or be psychically poisoned for one minute. While a creature is poisoned this way, it suffers the poisoned condition and takes 1d4 ongoing poison damage at the beginning of each of its turns. A creature may attempt this save again at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success.</p></li></ul>",
